{"t":"ON","made":"2026-11-06 14:38","name":"ON Semiconductor Corporation","ko":"온세미","sector":"Technology","industry":"Semiconductors","employees":22600,"hq":"Scottsdale, AZ, United States","website":"https://www.onsemi.com","summary_en":"ON Semiconductor Corporation provides intelligent sensing and power solutions in Hong Kong, Singapore, the United Kingdom, the United States, and internationally. It operates through three segments: Power Solutions Group, Analog and Mixed-Signal Group, and Intelligent Sensing Group. The Power Solutions Group segment offers discrete, module, and integrated semiconductor devices designed to enable power conversion, including power switching, signal conditioning, and circuit protection technologies. Its Analog and Mixed-Signal Group segment designs and develops analog and mixed-signal solutions, including power management, sensor interface, connectivity, and standard products for automotive, industrial automation, AI data centers, computing, and mobile end markets. The Intelligent Sensing Group segment develops complementary metal-oxide-semiconductor image sensors, image signal processors, short-wave infrared sensors, and other products, as well as photon-counting technologies, including single-photon avalanche diode arrays and silicon photomultiplier devices for depth sensing, factory automation, safety systems, and robotics industries. ON Semiconductor Corporation was incorporated in 1992 and is headquartered in Scottsdale, Arizona.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"ON Semiconductor Corporation은 홍콩, 싱가포르, 영국, 미국 및 전 세계에 지능형 감지 및 전력 솔루션을 제공합니다. 전력 솔루션 그룹, 아날로그 및 혼합 신호 그룹, 지능형 감지 그룹의 세 부분으로 운영됩니다. Power Solutions Group 부문은 전원 스위칭, 신호 조절 및 회로 보호 기술을 포함하여 전력 변환이 가능하도록 설계된 개별, 모듈 및 통합 반도체 장치를 제공합니다. 아날로그 및 혼합 신호 그룹 부문은 자동차, 산업 자동화, AI 데이터 센터, 컴퓨팅 및 모바일 최종 시장을 위한 전력 관리, 센서 인터페이스, 연결 및 표준 제품을 포함한 아날로그 및 혼합 신호 솔루션을 설계하고 개발합니다. 지능형 감지 그룹 부문은 깊이 감지, 공장 자동화, 안전 시스템 및 로봇 산업을 위한 단일 광자 애벌랜치 다이오드 어레이 및 실리콘 광전자 증배관 장치를 포함한 광자 계수 기술뿐만 아니라 보완적인 금속 산화물 반도체 이미지 센서, 이미지 신호 프로세서, 단파 적외선 센서 및 기타 제품을 개발합니다. ON Semiconductor Corporation은 1992년에 설립되었으며 애리조나주 스코츠데일에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":63.01,"mcap":24528814080.0,"pe":41.728477,"fpe":13.385479,"peg":0.1571,"ps":3.8511608,"pb":3.243925,"ev_ebitda":12.82,"div":0.0,"beta":2.151,"hi52":134.92,"lo52":44.56},"fin":{"rev":6369200128.0,"rev_g":0.111,"eps_g":0.261,"gross":0.39898,"op":0.22232,"net":0.10819,"roe":0.089090005,"fcf":1614162560.0,"cash":4367699968.0,"debt":4707800064.0,"de":62.097,"eps":1.51,"feps":4.70734},"own":{"short":0.1073,"inst":1.05858,"insider":0.00307},"analyst":{"n":25,"mean":98.56,"median":100.0,"high":137.0,"low":75.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.03448,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":2,"buy":13,"hold":14,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":2,"buy":13,"hold":16,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":2,"buy":12,"hold":16,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":2,"buy":11,"hold":16,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-04","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":80.0,"priorPriceTarget":98.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-03","Firm":"Truist Securities","ToGrade":"Hold","FromGrade":"Hold","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":76.0,"priorPriceTarget":75.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-03","Firm":"B. Riley Securities","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":97.0,"priorPriceTarget":105.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-03","Firm":"TD Cowen","ToGrade":"Hold","FromGrade":"Hold","Action":"reit","priceTargetAction":"Maintains","currentPriceTarget":75.0,"priorPriceTarget":75.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-03","Firm":"Evercore ISI Group","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":90.0,"priorPriceTarget":137.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-03","Firm